  "Fix: update LTK Manager, copy its new ltk_patcher_host.exe and ltk_patcher_dll.dll into Rose's tools folder, then restart Rose.": "Řešení: aktualizuj LTK Manager, zkopíruj jeho nové soubory ltk_patcher_host.exe a ltk_patcher_dll.dll do složky tools v Rose a restartuj Rose.",
