  "If something feels off, open the logs folder and share the latest log in a discord ticket.": "Jika ada yang terasa aneh, buka folder log dan bagikan log terbaru di tiket Discord.",
  "Fix: you're already at the maximum Injection Threshold. This usually means the injection is extremely slow. Try lighter mods, close heavy apps, move League/mods to an SSD, and consider adding antivirus exclusions for the League and Rose folders. Then retry.": "Solusi: ambang injeksimu sudah maksimum. Ini biasanya berarti injeksi sangat lambat. Coba mod yang lebih ringan, tutup aplikasi berat, pindahkan League/mod ke SSD, dan pertimbangkan menambahkan pengecualian antivirus untuk folder League dan Rose. Lalu coba lagi.",
  "Fix: based on {games} game(s), base skin confirmation takes up to {ms}ms (p90). Recommended threshold: {seconds}s. Use the \"Apply recommended\" button below, or increase \"Injection Threshold\" manually.": "Solusi: berdasarkan {games} game, konfirmasi skin dasar butuh hingga {ms} ms (p90). Ambang yang disarankan: {seconds} dtk. Gunakan tombol \"Terapkan\" di bawah, atau naikkan \"Ambang injeksi\" secara manual.",
  "Fix: increase \"Injection Threshold (seconds)\" and click Save. If the warning is still there, increase it again and Save again. Once the warning is gone, retry your skin selection.": "Solusi: naikkan \"Ambang injeksi (detik)\" lalu klik Simpan. Jika peringatannya masih ada, naikkan lagi dan simpan lagi. Setelah peringatannya hilang, pilih skin-mu lagi.",
  "Base skin verification failed (selected skin may not apply)": "Verifikasi skin dasar gagal (skin yang dipilih mungkin tidak diterapkan)",
  "Base skin forcing took too long (skin may not appear)": "Memaksa skin dasar memakan waktu terlalu lama (skin mungkin tidak muncul)",
  "What it means: the client didn't confirm the base skin change in time.": "Artinya: klien tidak mengonfirmasi perubahan skin dasar tepat waktu.",
  "What it means: forcing the base skin took too long, so the selected skin may not show.": "Artinya: memaksa skin dasar memakan waktu terlalu lama, jadi skin yang dipilih mungkin tidak tampil.",
  "Injection exceeded the timeout (process was stopped)": "Injeksi melewati batas waktu (proses dihentikan)",
  "What it means: injection took longer than the allowed time, so ROSE stopped the process.": "Artinya: injeksi berlangsung lebih lama dari waktu yang diizinkan, jadi ROSE menghentikan prosesnya.",
  "Fix: you're already at the maximum Monitor Auto-Resume Timeout. This usually means the injection is extremely slow. Try lighter mods, close heavy apps, move League/mods to an SSD, and consider adding antivirus exclusions for the League and Rose folders. Then retry.": "Solusi: batas waktu lanjut otomatismu sudah maksimum. Ini biasanya berarti injeksi sangat lambat. Coba mod yang lebih ringan, tutup aplikasi berat, pindahkan League/mod ke SSD, dan pertimbangkan menambahkan pengecualian antivirus untuk folder League dan Rose. Lalu coba lagi.",
  "Fix: increase \"Monitor Auto-Resume Timeout (seconds)\" and click Save. If the warning is still there, increase it again and Save again. Once the warning is gone, try again.": "Solusi: naikkan \"Batas waktu lanjut otomatis (detik)\" lalu klik Simpan. Jika peringatannya masih ada, naikkan lagi dan simpan lagi. Setelah peringatannya hilang, coba lagi.",
  "Not enough disk space for injection": "Ruang disk tidak cukup untuk injeksi",
  "What it means: Rose could not create the overlay for the selected skin.": "Artinya: Rose tidak bisa membuat overlay untuk skin yang dipilih.",
  "Fix: free up space on the drive containing Rose injection files, then retry. Map mods can require several GB.": "Solusi: kosongkan ruang di drive yang berisi file injeksi Rose, lalu coba lagi. Mod peta bisa butuh beberapa GB.",
  "LTK patcher is outdated (end of life reached)": "LTK patcher sudah usang (dukungan telah berakhir)",
  "What it means: your ltk_patcher_dll.dll no longer supports the current game build, so skins cannot be injected.": "Artinya: ltk_patcher_dll.dll milikmu tidak lagi mendukung versi game saat ini, jadi skin tidak bisa diinjeksi.",
  "Fix: update LTK Manager, copy its new ltk_patcher_host.exe and ltk_patcher_dll.dll into Rose's tools folder, then restart Rose.": "Solusi: perbarui LTK Manager, salin ltk_patcher_host.exe dan ltk_patcher_dll.dll yang baru ke folder tools Rose, lalu mulai ulang Rose.",
  "LTK patcher files are missing": "File LTK patcher tidak ada",
  "What it means: Rose needs ltk_patcher_host.exe and ltk_patcher_dll.dll to inject skins.": "Artinya: Rose butuh ltk_patcher_host.exe dan ltk_patcher_dll.dll untuk menginjeksi skin.",
  "Fix: copy both files from your LTK Manager install into Rose's tools folder, then restart Rose.": "Solusi: salin kedua file dari instalasi LTK Manager-mu ke folder tools Rose, lalu mulai ulang Rose.",
  "LTK patcher failed during injection": "LTK patcher gagal saat injeksi",
  "What happened: {detail}": "Yang terjadi: {detail}",
  "What happened: the LTK patcher reported an error.": "Yang terjadi: LTK patcher melaporkan error.",
  "Fix: make sure your LTK patcher files are up to date, then retry. Full output is in rose_runoverlay_*.log in the Rose logs folder.": "Solusi: pastikan file LTK patcher-mu sudah terbaru, lalu coba lagi. Output lengkap ada di rose_runoverlay_*.log di folder log Rose.",
