  "That's not a valid party token. Copy the whole token (it starts with ROSE:).": "Itu bukan token party yang valid. Salin seluruh token (diawali ROSE:).",
  "That's your own token - send it to your friends instead": "Itu token milikmu sendiri, kirimkan ke temanmu saja",
